  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Environmental Finance in Cuba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The project supports the creation of an enabling framework for environmental finance as an accelerator of the SDGs in Cuba, through three expected results that require a combined approach strategy, because together they lubricate and validate the proposed mechanism: i) create an inter-institutional mechanism that combines actors and processes to integrate the financial dimension into environmental management and the national development financing strategy; ii) design a roadmap and an action plan</narrative>
  </description>
